49. compounding of Offences,-Notwithstanding anything contained in theCode of Criminal Procedure, if any person Is punlshed'wlth imprlsonment under thisAct, the punishment may, either before or after the institution df the prosecution,be compounded by the court on such terms and conditions and on payment oF sLlchsums as may be piescribed:
